{"nodes": [{"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_farm_overview_screen", "label": "Farm Overview Dashboard Screen", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Landing screen of the Poultry Monitoring System. Composition is an 8-tile KPI grid across the top, then a two-column body: wider left column for environment and alerts, narrower right rail for finance, vision predictions and inventory. Answers 'is anything wrong right now?' before offering any navigation."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_kpi_tile_grid", "label": "KPI Tile Grid", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eight uniform cards (Active batches 1, Current population 932, Mortality today 0, Mortality rate % 1.8, Feed today kg 0, Critical alerts 0, Devices online 0, Devices offline 1), each with an all-caps label, a large numeral and a muted outline icon. Operational, health, and hardware status are deliberately given equal visual weight."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_mortality_rate_kpi", "label": "Mortality Rate KPI", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cumulative mortality rate of 1.8% shown as a headline tile, mirroring the per-batch mortality column so the farm-level and batch-level numbers reconcile visibly."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_device_health_kpi", "label": "Devices Online/Offline KPI", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Devices online 0 / devices offline 1 makes IoT link health a first-class dashboard metric, so stale sensor data is attributable to a dead node rather than misread as a calm environment."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_environment_24h_panel", "label": "Environment 24h Average Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three-up summary of temperature, humidity and gas-risk index rendered as em-dashes because it is 'Based on 0 good-quality readings'. Showing an explicit no-data state plus the sample count, instead of a zero or a stale value, is a deliberate trust decision."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_open_alerts_panel", "label": "Open Alerts Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Feed of severity-badged alerts with relative timestamps: 'High gas risk (High)', 'Visual indicator: open_beak_stress (58%)', 'Visual indicator: lethargic (62%)', all 3 weeks 4 days ago. Environmental threshold alerts and machine-vision alerts are unified in one stream so the operator has a single place to look."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_vision_predictions_panel", "label": "Recent Vision Predictions Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lists the latest CNN classifications with confidence scores (healthy 0.50, healthy 0.50, open_beak_stress 0.58, lethargic 0.62, healthy 0.91). Confidence is always displayed next to the label so a 0.50 near-coin-flip cannot be mistaken for a diagnosis; only the higher-confidence abnormal classes were promoted into Open alerts."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_vision_disclaimer", "label": "Machine-Vision Advisory Disclaimer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Persistent footer callout: 'Machine-vision predictions are early-warning indicators and do not replace veterinary diagnosis.' Positions the ML tier as decision support, bounding liability and setting user expectations about model reliability - the same honesty principle applied to the uncalibrated gas sensor."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_inventory_warnings_panel", "label": "Inventory Warnings Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Low-stock watcher that renders a reassuring empty state (check mark, 'Stock levels OK.') rather than a blank card, confirming the check ran."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_this_month_finance_panel", "label": "This Month Sales and Expenses Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Month-to-date roll-up of confirmed sales and expenses on the dashboard rail, linking the finance module into the operational overview."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_sidebar_navigation", "label": "PMS Grouped Sidebar Navigation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fixed dark-green rail branded 'PMS', with items grouped under four all-caps section headers - Farm Operations (Farms, Pens, Batches, Mortality, Feed usage, Weights, Observations), Health (Health records, Treatments, Vaccinations), Inventory & Finance (Inventory, Expenses, Sales) and Monitoring (Devices, Environment, Vision review). The grouping is the information architecture of the whole system made visible, and the green palette carries the agricultural brand."}, {"id": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_role_identity_badge", "label": "Signed-In User and Role Badge", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Top bar shows 'Admin Demo' with a 'System Administrator' role chip, repeated as 'Signed in as Admin Demo (System Administrator)' on the dashboard. Persistent role display implies role-based access control where visible menu items and actions depend on the active role."}], "edges": [{"source": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_farm_overview_screen", "target": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_kpi_tile_grid", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_farm_overview_screen", "target": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_environment_24h_panel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_farm_overview_screen", "target": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_open_alerts_panel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "figures/screenshots/web_dashboard.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_farm_overview_screen", "target": "figures_screenshots_web_dashboard_vision_predictions_panel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "